      "content": "it's hard to even \"find purpose\" when everything feels so rigged. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's just the same gray walls every single day. i feel so trapped by it all. like there's no way out of the loop unless the loop just... stops.",
